Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 04:29:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add UX motion: scroll reveals, hero entrance, marquee,
 back-to-top, smooth FAQ

- Reveal component: sections fade up on scroll (IntersectionObserver, reduced-motion safe)
- Hero entrance: staggered fade-up on headline, copy, CTAs, trust points, image
- Marquee: slim scrolling services strip below hero (decorative, aria-hidden, pauses on hover)
- BackToTop: floating button appears after scrolling, opposite WhatsApp button
- FAQ accordion: smooth height animation instead of instant toggle
- Smooth scrolling for anchor links (reduced-motion guarded)
- Note: navbar hide-on-scroll + active link already existed upstream; left untouched
